teCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-02\",\"runtime\":18},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Prepare Red Flavor Healthy Dishes for Malbok!\",\"overview\":\"Red healthy dishes rather than fried chickens for boknal? Love it even more. Losing appetite with the hot weather...? We got red flavor healthy foods that will bring back your appetite! Eunbi-certified soul food and a healthy dish she didn't want to get used to...\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-09\",\"runtime\":14},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"99 Boss Na Sunuk vs Maepjjiri Master Kwon Eunbi: Spicy Blind D\",\"overview\":\"What's the biggest concern before going on a blind date? Hair? No, outfit? No, makeup? No. It could be deciding what to eat! There's a research saying that eating spicy food with a person of opposite sex results in elevating your heart rate! That's quite interesting... So, the Maepjjiri Master decided to see if the study results are valid! But it's with a man whose charm is more mesmerizing than spicy food.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-16\",\"runtime\":16},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Eating Shin Ramyun The Red with Yuri who took a taxi here\",\"overview\":\"Shin Ramyun The Red's appearance in the middle of the night... How interesting! Shin Ramyun is considered the standard of spicy food whichever restaurant you go! But, what if you want a spicier & deeper version of it? Shin Ramyun The Red is available for those people! Then, can maepjjiri eat Shin Ramyun The Red as well? For maepjjiri who are curious, I'll try it with my little maepjjiri sister, Yuri, as well!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-23\",\"runtime\":17},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Here to see the master!🐰Silbi Kimchi-jjim for Princess Bunny, Tsuki\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-30\",\"runtime\":16},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Let's make the spiciest chicken🔥Story of Eunbi's new spicy sauce\",\"ov